    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Well, I'm proud to be from the state of Florida. Well, we've been paying attention to this for some time. In fact, as you know, I have been aggressively defending some of these things that we have done in court to protect the safety and security of this nation and what we could do in Florida. So that included trying to protect farmland, making sure that we were protecting our military bases, making sure, you know, we were protecting our universities from those that were coming in and seeking to steal intellectual property that would benefit, you know, the development of another nation-states military. So, you know, we have been on top of this in Florida. I am hoping, and President Trump has been great bringing so much of our leadership into the administration and into Washington to help with these efforts. You know, I want to make America like Florida, making sure that we are paying attention to this, that we are staying diligent, that we are working hard. And you know, again, the Chinese people, no one is saying that we don't have compassion for the Chinese people or the students that want to come here. What we're saying is we cannot be ignorant to the agenda and the actions of the Chinese government and the ways they seek to exploit American generosity and opportunity for their own gain.",
